808 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 232 0 R
/E (The future scope of this project includes improving the sentiment analysis system by using larger and more diverse movie review datasets and implementing advanced deep learning and Natural Language Processing techniques such as LSTM, RNN, and Transformer-based models like BERT. The project can also be extended to perform multi-class sentiment analysis, emotion detection, and real-time review prediction from online platforms. Additional improvements such as multilingual sentiment analysis, sarcasm detection, and deployment as a web application can further enhance the accuracy, efficiency, and practical usability of the system in real-world applications.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [7]
>>
