2033 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project focuses on analyzing movie reviews using Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and Machine Learning techniques to classify sentiments as positive or negative. Various preprocessing methods, feature extraction techniques, and classification algorithms were implemented and compared to evaluate model performance and improve sentiment prediction accuracy.)
/Dest [9 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 841 0 R
>>
endobj
2034 0 obj
<<
/Title (OBJECTIVE)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 841 0 R
