/Title (The SVM confusion matrix illustrates the model's strong capability in distinguishing between positive and negative sentiments in movie reviews. It reveals that the classifier correctly identified 4,326 negative reviews \(True Negatives\) and 4,438 positive reviews \(True Positives\). The visualization indicates a high level of precision, with only 613 false positives and 540 false negatives recorded across the test set. This balanced distribution of correct predictions along the diagonal highlights the effectiveness of the Support Vector Machine in handling the linguistic complexities of the dataset with minimal classification error.)
